WEBVTT

01:30.920 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.070 --> 01:37.979
[Episode 16]

01:38.789 --> 01:39.870
Pingyuan, what kind of business

01:39.870 --> 01:41.200
is this shop going to be?

01:41.400 --> 01:42.789
You're the head manager now.

01:42.789 --> 01:43.440
You tell me.

01:43.440 --> 01:44.560
I'll decide?

01:44.789 --> 01:45.520
Well then...

01:47.890 --> 01:55.270
[Ping]

01:48.789 --> 01:50.850
I think we can sell boating supplies.

01:51.920 --> 01:52.610
Pingyuan,

01:52.720 --> 01:53.789
the entrance to Huizhou Prefecture

01:53.789 --> 01:54.789
is right by a dock.

01:54.840 --> 01:55.930
Most of the people

01:56.070 --> 01:57.310
coming and going are boatmen.

01:57.310 --> 01:59.039
If we sell boating supplies,

01:59.229 --> 02:00.560
we could make a fortune.

02:02.330 --> 02:03.310
Actually, that's not ideal.

02:03.310 --> 02:05.790
There are already
too many boating suppliers.

02:05.790 --> 02:07.950
Let's sell general merchandise instead.

02:07.950 --> 02:08.680
Like premium items,

02:08.680 --> 02:09.740
such as Jinhua Ham,

02:09.889 --> 02:10.990
Osmanthus Duck,

02:11.240 --> 02:12.170
wind-dried chicken, wind-dried fish,

02:12.170 --> 02:12.770
and jerky.

02:15.170 --> 02:17.630
But these items
are a bit difficult to store.

02:19.630 --> 02:20.610
If you ask me,

02:20.840 --> 02:22.470
you should put everything on the line

02:22.470 --> 02:23.870
and open a grocery store.

02:24.829 --> 02:27.160
Don't count on making money from the shop.

02:27.630 --> 02:29.030
The main purpose is for you to learn

02:29.030 --> 02:30.360
how to deal with people.

02:30.910 --> 02:32.710
You need to learn to use your eyes

02:33.120 --> 02:34.650
and your ears to make money.

02:35.950 --> 02:36.960
Pingyuan, you're teasing me again.

02:36.960 --> 02:38.290
How can ears make money?

02:38.520 --> 02:39.320
Let me ask you,

02:39.590 --> 02:40.400
what do you think

02:40.400 --> 02:42.160
is the most important thing in business?

02:42.160 --> 02:43.690
I've heard a saying before.

02:43.910 --> 02:45.710
Have what others lack;
excel at what others have.

02:45.710 --> 02:46.890
That's an old saying.

02:46.890 --> 02:47.910
But how do you know

02:47.910 --> 02:48.990
what others don't have?

02:48.990 --> 02:49.890
How do you know

02:49.910 --> 02:51.370
what others need the most?

02:53.840 --> 02:54.560
Just now

02:54.590 --> 02:55.480
on our way here,

02:55.800 --> 02:57.470
there was a business opportunity.

02:57.470 --> 02:58.630
You could earn

02:58.870 --> 03:00.530
thousands of taels of silver.

03:00.680 --> 03:01.960
Thousands of taels?

03:02.190 --> 03:03.050
Are you interested?

03:03.050 --> 03:07.790
[Ping]

03:03.800 --> 03:04.470
Pingyuan.

03:05.030 --> 03:06.050
Even the Governor

03:06.120 --> 03:07.720
can't earn that much.

03:07.840 --> 03:09.310
Forget thousands of taels.

03:09.310 --> 03:10.510
Even for 1,000 taels,

03:10.590 --> 03:12.390
I'd kneel down and kowtow to you.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.020
Manager, Boss.

03:16.230 --> 03:17.240
I didn't dare to buy you alcohol.

03:17.240 --> 03:18.560
This fruit wine is very light.

03:18.560 --> 03:19.680
Perfect for quenching your thirst.

03:19.680 --> 03:20.280
Thank you.

03:20.870 --> 03:21.320
Oh, right.

03:21.320 --> 03:22.470
I need to trouble you two.

03:22.470 --> 03:23.310
Please help me buy

03:23.310 --> 03:24.570
1,000 chi of hemp rope.

03:24.590 --> 03:26.200
About as thick as a finger will do.

03:26.200 --> 03:29.810
[Ping]

03:26.400 --> 03:27.840
And 100 meters of fishing line,

03:27.840 --> 03:30.170
100 meters of silk ribbons for tying hair,

03:30.240 --> 03:31.170
and 5 water vats.

03:31.400 --> 03:32.280
Then go to the stationery store

03:32.280 --> 03:34.000
and buy some adhesive clay for making ink.

03:34.000 --> 03:34.760
Soak it

03:34.910 --> 03:35.910
in the water vats.

03:36.030 --> 03:36.890
Hurry and do it.

03:36.910 --> 03:37.440
Alright.

03:37.680 --> 03:38.210
Let's go.

03:39.240 --> 03:40.840
What are you buying all these things for?

03:40.840 --> 03:41.960
To make money, of course.

03:41.960 --> 03:42.750
Make money? These things

03:42.750 --> 03:44.480
don't make any sense together.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.470
Stop keeping me in suspense.

03:48.470 --> 03:49.200
My brain is slow,

03:49.200 --> 03:50.130
as you well know.

03:50.190 --> 03:50.960
If you make me figure it out,

03:50.960 --> 03:52.420
my head will explode soon.

03:52.560 --> 03:53.750
Soon, you'll use a chopper

03:53.750 --> 03:55.050
to cut the 1,000-chi hemp rope

03:55.050 --> 03:56.490
into sections of 4 chi each,

03:56.490 --> 03:57.410
one by one,

03:57.960 --> 03:59.150
and put them in the vats.

03:59.150 --> 04:00.470
When they turn black,

04:00.470 --> 04:01.200
take them out

04:01.400 --> 04:03.050
and tie them with fishing line

04:03.050 --> 04:04.240
before adding silk ribbons.

04:04.240 --> 04:06.040
What do you think they look like?

04:06.680 --> 04:07.610
Braided queues?

04:09.240 --> 04:10.700
Over 1,000 chi of hemp rope

04:10.710 --> 04:12.060
should be enough

04:12.560 --> 04:14.000
to make more than 200 braided queues.

04:14.000 --> 04:14.920
We don't need to charge much.

04:14.920 --> 04:16.519
Just 10 taels of silver each.

04:16.920 --> 04:18.630
Just some hemp rope?

04:19.040 --> 04:20.560
Would you buy it from me?

04:20.630 --> 04:22.089
Of course, I don't want it.

04:22.120 --> 04:23.870
The key is where you're going to sell it.

04:23.870 --> 04:25.090
Hefei has just been

04:25.390 --> 04:27.000
occupied by the Southern Army.

04:27.000 --> 04:28.190
Soldiers are coming

04:28.210 --> 04:29.430
from all directions to surround them.

04:29.430 --> 04:30.490
They can't escape.

04:31.070 --> 04:32.130
They're finished.

04:33.040 --> 04:34.440
If you sell them

04:34.830 --> 04:36.390
near Hefei at this time,

04:36.510 --> 04:37.370
I guarantee you

04:37.630 --> 04:38.490
within 2 hours,

04:38.920 --> 04:41.120
all the braided queues will be sold out.

04:42.310 --> 04:43.950
Sell them to those people?

04:47.110 --> 04:48.270
When they first entered Huizhou,

04:48.270 --> 04:49.380
how many people were there?

04:49.380 --> 04:50.110
Over 30,000.

04:50.630 --> 04:51.270
And now?

04:51.760 --> 04:53.720
They claim to have an army of 100,000.

04:53.720 --> 04:54.720
So where did those

04:54.750 --> 04:56.070
tens of thousands come from?

04:56.070 --> 04:57.310
Just ruffians and scoundrels

04:57.310 --> 04:58.270
who joined on their own.

04:58.270 --> 04:58.950
They're not

04:59.000 --> 05:00.480
truly committed to rebellion

05:00.480 --> 05:01.470
or fighting.

05:01.920 --> 05:03.680
Once the tide of war turns against them,

05:03.680 --> 05:04.630
they'll be quick to flee

05:04.630 --> 05:05.870
at the first opportunity.

05:05.870 --> 05:07.670
But they have no braided queues.

05:08.000 --> 05:09.480
If they're caught
by the imperial court's army,

05:09.480 --> 05:11.140
it's still a capital offense.

05:11.430 --> 05:12.830
Hair is easy to shave off,

05:12.920 --> 05:14.450
but not so easy to grow back.

05:14.950 --> 05:16.160
Never mind 10 taels.

05:16.680 --> 05:18.010
Even if you charge more,

05:18.310 --> 05:20.040
they'll still have to buy them.

05:21.240 --> 05:22.060
Really?

05:22.560 --> 05:23.780
But I warn you.

05:24.560 --> 05:26.310
This business can only be done once.

05:26.310 --> 05:28.510
The second time will cost you your head.

05:30.870 --> 05:32.600
Even once might be a close call.

05:33.480 --> 05:35.440
Pingyuan, what about the tea plantation?

05:35.440 --> 05:37.570
I didn't ask you to watch it all the time.

05:37.570 --> 05:38.750
There are 2 assistants here

05:38.750 --> 05:39.800
taking care of things.

05:39.800 --> 05:41.040
When it's time to harvest the tea,

05:41.040 --> 05:41.900
you can go back.

05:42.680 --> 05:43.510
Remember this.

05:43.510 --> 05:45.000
For merchants to make money,

05:45.000 --> 05:46.460
information comes first.

05:47.159 --> 05:48.159
Keep your ears open

05:48.159 --> 05:49.020
and stay alert.

05:52.070 --> 05:52.600
Alright.

05:52.720 --> 05:53.600
I'm heading back.

05:53.600 --> 05:55.659
I'm leaving the business here to you.

05:56.630 --> 05:57.230
Pingyuan,

05:57.310 --> 05:58.560
there's one more thing.

05:58.560 --> 06:00.920
It's about Miss Bai's matter.

06:01.310 --> 06:02.100
Mother

06:02.190 --> 06:03.890
and Mr. Bai still have

06:04.070 --> 06:05.330
a knot in their hearts.

06:06.070 --> 06:07.600
You should make a decision.

06:09.750 --> 06:10.390
I've been thinking about

06:10.390 --> 06:11.990
talking to her one more time.

06:12.870 --> 06:13.830
But I don't know

06:14.720 --> 06:15.600
what to say.

06:21.550 --> 06:26.260
[Hefei]

06:34.530 --> 06:36.330
[Make way]

06:36.430 --> 06:38.070
[Harmony] [Forever]

07:20.830 --> 07:23.630
Princess Consort,
please get out of the carriage.

07:25.270 --> 07:26.120
Ms. Su.

07:26.800 --> 07:28.460
I'm not any Princess Consort.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.680
Don't call me that.

07:30.830 --> 07:32.020
Leaving that door

07:32.150 --> 07:33.550
means entering another.

07:40.800 --> 07:41.340
Why?

07:41.990 --> 07:42.740
You want to go back

07:42.740 --> 07:44.400
and get arrested for treason?

08:03.740 --> 08:04.710
Watch your step.

08:33.510 --> 08:35.110
Princess Consort, let's go.

09:06.320 --> 09:10.850
♪ Tea picking in January
marks the new year ♪

09:11.150 --> 09:15.510
♪ Tea picking in February
welcomes the new spring ♪

09:16.070 --> 09:20.550
♪ Tea picking takes place in March,
as peach blossoms blush crimson ♪

09:20.750 --> 09:25.240
♪ Tea picking in April makes us busy ♪

09:28.030 --> 09:29.170
This way! This way!

09:29.320 --> 09:30.400
Slow down!

09:34.670 --> 09:35.910
Don't run so fast!

10:06.320 --> 10:08.120
Everyone has their own sorrows.

10:08.390 --> 10:10.320
Mr. Gu, you have an emotional scar.

10:10.360 --> 10:11.890
I've brought the medicine.

10:13.790 --> 10:14.390
You've finally agreed

10:14.390 --> 10:15.450
to take me to Hefei?

10:18.840 --> 10:19.500
Why do I feel

10:19.510 --> 10:21.640
I'm getting the short end of this deal?

10:23.510 --> 10:24.840
What can you promise me?

10:25.600 --> 10:26.800
Why should I help you?

10:30.670 --> 10:32.860
Look at you, half dead.

10:32.960 --> 10:33.790
I'm half dead

10:33.820 --> 10:35.230
all thanks to you.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.270
You took Yimei

10:39.290 --> 10:40.490
to Hefei, didn't you?

10:41.200 --> 10:41.960
Yes.

10:43.170 --> 10:43.960
I personally escorted her

10:43.960 --> 10:45.360
to the Prince's Mansion.

10:46.000 --> 10:48.270
Commanding General Li Cheng
has been promoted to Prince Cheng.

10:48.270 --> 10:50.070
She's now his Princess Consort.

10:51.240 --> 10:52.480
You need to think carefully

10:52.480 --> 10:53.800
how many heads you have

10:53.910 --> 10:55.970
to dare bother the Princess Consort?

10:57.390 --> 10:58.940
I'm not going to bother her.

11:00.500 --> 11:01.960
I'm going to drag her back.

11:03.450 --> 11:04.780
Her father is my mentor.

11:05.390 --> 11:06.100
The old man now

11:06.100 --> 11:07.760
has barely half his life left.

11:08.150 --> 11:10.010
As fragile as a candle in the wind.

11:10.060 --> 11:10.920
What about her?

11:11.150 --> 11:13.010
She's out there having a good time

11:13.360 --> 11:14.960
while others suffer for her.

11:27.240 --> 11:29.440
How do you know she's enjoying herself?

11:30.120 --> 11:31.850
I don't even dare to go home now.

11:33.120 --> 11:33.870
When I see her father,

11:33.870 --> 11:35.400
I don't know how to explain.

11:38.480 --> 11:40.140
I can't face my mother either.

11:40.720 --> 11:41.320
Fine.

11:41.910 --> 11:42.960
I'll bring her back.

11:42.960 --> 11:44.480
Can you guarantee
she won't run away again?

11:44.480 --> 11:45.870
Or are you going to drive her to death

11:45.870 --> 11:47.930
just to make yourselves feel better?

11:58.430 --> 11:59.960
Those on the opposite side of the river

11:59.960 --> 12:01.690
think about different things.

12:03.350 --> 12:04.810
She has crossed the river.

12:04.830 --> 12:06.560
It's useless for you to linger.

12:09.130 --> 12:10.830
This is my last advice.

12:18.600 --> 12:19.540
No matter what,

12:22.220 --> 12:23.030
I beg you

12:24.480 --> 12:25.610
to take me to see her.

12:26.640 --> 12:31.680
[Desheng Gate]

12:31.770 --> 12:35.400
[Li]

12:35.630 --> 12:36.240
Ms. Su,

12:36.670 --> 12:37.630
His Highness instructed

12:37.630 --> 12:38.360
that recently, there have been many spies

12:38.360 --> 12:39.750
who infiltrated Hefei.

12:40.110 --> 12:41.240
We must be cautious.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.050
Need to check the goods.

12:43.240 --> 12:43.720
Sure.

12:46.510 --> 12:49.120
[Li]

12:56.540 --> 12:57.100
These are all

12:57.100 --> 12:58.420
purchased for His Highness,

12:58.420 --> 12:59.890
for future use by the navy.

13:00.150 --> 13:01.750
I hired more than 10 porters.

13:14.870 --> 13:17.260
[Li]

13:22.320 --> 13:23.380
It's a Qing Bandit!

13:23.530 --> 13:25.050
Qing Bandit! Qing Bandit! Qing Bandit!

13:24.290 --> 13:25.350
[Desheng Gate]

13:25.150 --> 13:26.000
Qing Bandit!

13:26.710 --> 13:27.510
Who are you?

13:32.750 --> 13:33.790
Who are you?

13:35.080 --> 13:36.280
When I hired porters,

13:36.290 --> 13:37.890
I don't remember seeing you.

13:40.630 --> 13:41.400
Seize him!

13:41.720 --> 13:42.790
No, wait! Wait!

13:48.290 --> 13:49.630
If I didn't keep this braided queue,

13:49.630 --> 13:50.460
who would carry

13:50.460 --> 13:51.990
these goods out of Huizhou?

13:52.630 --> 13:53.790
If I didn't have this braided queue,

13:53.790 --> 13:54.320
I would've been beheaded

13:54.320 --> 13:55.980
the moment I entered Huizhou.

13:56.740 --> 13:57.470
Ms. Su,

13:58.360 --> 13:59.370
I can leave today.

13:59.790 --> 14:00.960
From now on, I can't handle

14:00.960 --> 14:02.600
His Highness's affairs anymore.

14:02.600 --> 14:03.260
Wait.

14:04.120 --> 14:05.380
It really doesn't trouble him.

14:05.380 --> 14:06.500
Ms. Su, this...

14:06.720 --> 14:07.240
Enough.

14:07.480 --> 14:08.450
He's with us.

14:08.530 --> 14:09.230
Let him through.

14:09.230 --> 14:10.710
[Li]

14:09.390 --> 14:10.850
I was just joking earlier.

14:12.720 --> 14:13.250
Alright.

14:18.300 --> 14:21.150
[Li]

14:26.190 --> 14:29.450
[Desheng Gate]

14:30.490 --> 14:31.890
You almost got me killed.

14:33.630 --> 14:35.090
Who else would I mess with?

14:43.340 --> 14:45.230
[Desheng Gate]

14:59.440 --> 15:00.370
Are you okay now?

15:03.750 --> 15:04.400
Bro.

15:04.420 --> 15:05.150
Are you alright?

15:05.150 --> 15:05.670
Bro.

15:06.750 --> 15:08.750
How could I let anything happen to you?

15:08.750 --> 15:09.360
Let me see

15:09.380 --> 15:10.640
what's in your basket.

15:12.010 --> 15:13.120
Go keep watch.

15:25.390 --> 15:26.080
This...

15:29.750 --> 15:30.520
Listen, bro.

15:30.900 --> 15:32.550
Isn't this just hemp rope?

15:33.910 --> 15:35.060
Yes, it's hemp rope.

15:36.390 --> 15:37.270
Where do you expect me

15:37.270 --> 15:37.870
to get so much

15:37.870 --> 15:39.000
real human hair from?

15:39.000 --> 15:39.860
Forget it then.

15:40.080 --> 15:40.740
No, no, no.

15:40.960 --> 15:41.490
I want it.

15:41.820 --> 15:42.900
Hemp rope is fine.

15:43.840 --> 15:46.300
But 10 taels of silver

15:46.670 --> 15:47.510
is too unfair.

15:48.670 --> 15:50.070
Let me be honest with you.

15:50.150 --> 15:51.950
If you weren't from my hometown,

15:51.950 --> 15:52.790
I wouldn't even sell it

15:52.790 --> 15:54.050
for 10 taels of silver.

15:54.390 --> 15:56.450
If the soldiers discover this stuff,

15:56.600 --> 15:57.870
I'll lose

15:57.910 --> 15:58.790
my livelihood.

16:00.030 --> 16:01.040
There are 1,000 in total.

16:01.040 --> 16:01.900
Ten taels each.

16:01.960 --> 16:03.020
Take it or leave it.

16:10.470 --> 16:12.400
Don't even think about robbing me.

16:13.550 --> 16:15.010
T-These are just samples.

16:15.390 --> 16:17.390
I've left the 1,000 pieces in my cart

16:17.510 --> 16:19.570
which is parked on the official road.

16:19.600 --> 16:22.740
I-If you have any bad intentions,

16:23.000 --> 16:24.800
you'll only get these 10 pieces.

16:28.120 --> 16:28.800
Bro,

16:29.030 --> 16:30.440
what are you talking about?

16:30.440 --> 16:31.080
Think about it.

16:31.080 --> 16:32.140
We're buying these

16:32.320 --> 16:33.650
to hide them away

16:33.690 --> 16:34.790
for the day

16:35.080 --> 16:36.410
we might need to escape.

16:36.510 --> 16:37.440
Here's what we'll do.

16:37.440 --> 16:38.510
I'll send 2 men

16:38.630 --> 16:39.690
to go with you to get the cart.

16:39.690 --> 16:40.550
I'll pay you.

16:41.870 --> 16:43.130
But there's one thing.

16:43.590 --> 16:44.870
One thousand pieces aren't enough.

16:44.870 --> 16:45.960
I have an entire battalion.

16:45.960 --> 16:46.470
There are

16:46.470 --> 16:47.960
at least 2 or 3 thousand men.

16:47.960 --> 16:49.480
That's not enough to go around.

16:49.480 --> 16:50.740
You need to get me more.

16:50.790 --> 16:52.330
That's no problem at all.

16:52.960 --> 16:54.350
For business like this,

16:54.600 --> 16:56.640
the more the better, of course.

17:01.320 --> 17:01.840
Si.

17:02.550 --> 17:03.000
Uncle.

17:03.440 --> 17:04.280
The banknotes...

17:04.280 --> 17:05.400
Hurry up now.

17:12.030 --> 17:13.000
It...

17:13.000 --> 17:14.460
It really hurts my wallet.

17:14.630 --> 17:15.960
We work our butts off

17:16.030 --> 17:17.160
day and night,

17:17.829 --> 17:19.200
only to benefit you profiteers,

17:19.200 --> 17:19.730
don't we?

17:44.960 --> 17:46.000
Why are you looking at me?

17:46.000 --> 17:47.260
I've brought you here.

17:47.840 --> 17:49.350
Aren't you taking me inside?

17:49.350 --> 17:50.790
How can I get past all those guards?

17:50.790 --> 17:52.240
That's not my problem.

17:52.720 --> 17:53.750
You only asked me

17:53.790 --> 17:54.920
to bring you to the Prince's Mansion.

17:54.920 --> 17:55.590
You never said

17:55.590 --> 17:56.850
I had to get you inside.

17:57.960 --> 17:59.070
I have official business to attend to.

17:59.070 --> 18:00.070
Go in by yourself.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.450
I forgot to remind you earlier.

18:15.920 --> 18:17.980
If your braided queue falls out again

18:18.110 --> 18:20.400
and someone sees it,
they'll kill you on the spot.

18:20.400 --> 18:22.400
It won't be my responsibility then.

18:24.920 --> 18:25.450
Let's go.

18:51.090 --> 18:52.550
Where exactly did you put the goods?

18:52.550 --> 18:53.750
Don't try any tricks.

18:55.970 --> 18:56.920
Just up ahead.

19:28.010 --> 19:29.270
Count them carefully.

19:29.440 --> 19:30.510
There are 1,000 pieces in total.

19:30.510 --> 19:32.370
I won't make up for any shortages.

19:33.750 --> 19:34.640
Tell your commander

19:34.640 --> 19:36.040
I'll be back in a few days.

19:41.270 --> 19:41.870
Manager!

19:42.230 --> 19:42.860
Manager!

19:43.160 --> 19:44.360
Wait for me, Manager!

19:44.400 --> 19:45.600
Wait for me, Manager!

19:54.830 --> 19:56.280
-Manager!
-Manager!

19:56.310 --> 19:56.960
Manager!

19:57.680 --> 19:59.010
Manager! Wait for me!

19:59.070 --> 19:59.820
Manager!

20:16.180 --> 20:17.000
Is it true?

20:17.660 --> 20:18.640
Really?

20:22.890 --> 20:23.660
Manager.

20:23.750 --> 20:25.290
-It's true!
-It's true!

20:25.350 --> 20:26.950
The real deal! The real deal!

20:29.160 --> 20:30.070
How much did we cost

20:30.070 --> 20:31.510
to make these 1,000 braid queues?

20:31.510 --> 20:32.030
Ten...

20:32.150 --> 20:33.340
Ten copper coins!

20:33.440 --> 20:35.230
Including labor costs.

20:35.640 --> 20:36.710
Ten copper coins!

20:36.880 --> 20:38.510
It's like a dream!

20:39.200 --> 20:40.400
I've never seen

20:40.480 --> 20:41.420
this much money!

20:42.550 --> 20:43.270
Hurry back.

20:43.400 --> 20:44.640
Let's make another batch.

20:44.640 --> 20:45.790
Make another batch right away.

20:45.790 --> 20:46.400
Okay.

20:47.480 --> 20:48.070
Wait.

20:48.880 --> 20:49.680
Didn't Boss say

20:49.680 --> 20:51.370
we could only do this once?

20:51.720 --> 20:52.600
Boss said?

20:52.920 --> 20:54.210
Is he a god or what?

20:54.790 --> 20:55.350
Let me tell you.

20:55.350 --> 20:56.240
On this official road,

20:56.240 --> 20:57.510
i-it's very safe!

20:57.640 --> 20:58.780
Don't listen to him!

20:59.070 --> 21:00.250
I am the manager!

21:00.310 --> 21:01.400
I am the manager!

21:01.480 --> 21:02.210
Me!

21:03.850 --> 21:04.240
Yes.

21:04.260 --> 21:04.920
Okay. Okay.

21:06.870 --> 21:08.000
We're getting rich!

21:08.070 --> 21:08.790
We're getting rich!

21:08.790 --> 21:09.920
We're getting rich!

21:16.350 --> 21:17.320
Come on! Come on!

21:17.510 --> 21:18.640
Hiring workers! Hiring!

21:18.640 --> 21:19.100
Come on!

21:19.110 --> 21:20.030
Four copper coins per person.

21:20.030 --> 21:20.790
Want to load the warehouse?

21:20.790 --> 21:21.400
Four copper coins?

21:21.400 --> 21:22.180
I'll go! I'll go!

21:22.180 --> 21:23.150
Come over if you're going.

21:23.150 --> 21:24.210
Four copper coins.

21:24.830 --> 21:26.030
Are you coming or not?

21:26.030 --> 21:26.630
Hurry.

21:26.830 --> 21:27.160
You!

21:28.640 --> 21:29.240
Young man,

21:30.030 --> 21:31.070
why are you being lazy?

21:31.070 --> 21:33.130
Isn't four copper coins good enough?

21:33.280 --> 21:34.030
I've seen you hanging around

21:34.030 --> 21:35.110
here all day.

21:36.720 --> 21:37.790
They say the Princess Consort here

21:37.790 --> 21:39.070
is as beautiful as a painting.

21:39.070 --> 21:39.920
I don't believe it.

21:39.920 --> 21:41.250
I want to see for myself.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.830
You can't even afford food,

21:42.830 --> 21:44.200
and you're thinking about
seeing the Princess Consort?

21:44.200 --> 21:46.270
The Princess Consort only comes out
on the first and 15th day of the month

21:46.270 --> 21:48.310
to accompany His Highness
to inspect the entire city.

21:48.310 --> 21:49.270
Go dream on.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.710
Come on!

21:53.200 --> 21:55.100
Fortune is right before our eyes.

22:09.680 --> 22:11.470
What does this braided queue
look like to you?

22:11.470 --> 22:12.930
-Like a wife!
-Like a wife!

22:54.550 --> 22:55.610
Make way! Make way!

22:55.790 --> 22:57.920
His Highness and the Princess Consort
are out touring the city!

22:57.920 --> 22:58.480
What's going on?

22:58.480 --> 22:59.010
Make way!

22:59.240 --> 23:00.400
Make way! Make way! Make way!

23:00.400 --> 23:01.480
Make way! Make way! Make way!

23:01.480 --> 23:03.610
Quickly, make way! Make way! Make way!

23:03.750 --> 23:05.350
-Go! Go!
-Make way! Make way!

23:24.490 --> 23:28.270
[Four Seasons Tea House]

23:52.000 --> 23:52.720
Yimei!

23:53.160 --> 23:53.940
Yimei!

23:54.350 --> 23:54.960
Yimei!

23:55.720 --> 23:56.200
Yimei!

23:56.240 --> 23:56.640
A spy!

23:56.660 --> 23:57.180
Yimei!

24:03.440 --> 24:04.610
This damn weather.

24:05.240 --> 24:05.960
It's too hot.

24:05.960 --> 24:06.710
Way too hot.

24:08.160 --> 24:08.630
Buddy.

24:09.490 --> 24:10.710
Those 1,000 braided queues from last time

24:10.710 --> 24:11.270
don't do.

24:11.480 --> 24:12.540
They look too fake.

24:12.660 --> 24:13.760
No way.

24:14.200 --> 24:14.920
If they did,

24:15.220 --> 24:16.680
you would lose your heads.

24:17.110 --> 24:18.770
I won't let that happen to you.

24:19.270 --> 24:20.200
As businessmen,

24:20.230 --> 24:22.480
we value honesty.

24:22.510 --> 24:23.440
We still need to work together.

24:23.440 --> 24:24.590
I'll trust you one more time.

24:24.590 --> 24:25.550
There can't be any problems this time.

24:25.550 --> 24:26.200
Sure.

24:26.480 --> 24:27.550
Still 1,000 pieces.

24:27.550 --> 24:28.790
Count them carefully.

24:28.790 --> 24:29.510
Like I said before,

24:29.510 --> 24:30.990
I won't make up for any shortages.

24:30.990 --> 24:32.050
Alright. Alright.

24:37.680 --> 24:39.160
Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

24:39.160 --> 24:40.200
Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

24:40.200 --> 24:41.050
Don't kill me!

24:48.350 --> 24:49.580
Where is the Princess Consort?

24:49.580 --> 24:50.820
The Princess Consort wasn't feeling well,

24:50.820 --> 24:52.080
so she went back first.

24:52.160 --> 24:52.680
I heard

24:52.700 --> 24:54.100
you've just caught a spy.

24:54.230 --> 24:57.760
[Li]

24:54.480 --> 24:55.610
Yes, Your Highness.

25:01.350 --> 25:02.130
Bring him in.

25:02.350 --> 25:03.290
Bring him in!

25:08.070 --> 25:10.080
Kneel! Kneel! Kneel!

25:11.670 --> 25:12.890
[Weiwu Gate]

25:16.910 --> 25:20.490
[Li]

25:22.240 --> 25:23.700
Are these what you bought?

25:27.960 --> 25:29.790
When you first joined me,

25:30.630 --> 25:33.160
you cut off your braided queues
voluntarily.

25:33.290 --> 25:34.220
Now what?

25:34.670 --> 25:35.730
You want to go back?

25:36.670 --> 25:38.110
I'm afraid that's not possible.

25:38.110 --> 25:39.910
Please spare us, Your Highness!

25:40.030 --> 25:41.900
We just wanted a way out!

25:46.740 --> 25:48.940
You chose to be a coward over a tough man.

25:50.060 --> 25:52.460
Killing a coward
would only dirty my hands.

25:54.620 --> 25:55.880
Strip them of their clothes

25:55.880 --> 25:57.540
and drive them out of the city.

25:57.680 --> 25:58.590
Strip them

25:58.880 --> 25:59.920
and drive them out!

25:59.920 --> 26:00.670
Yes!

25:59.950 --> 26:02.120
[Weiwu Gate]

26:01.790 --> 26:02.190
Get up.

26:02.750 --> 26:03.240
Move.

26:04.790 --> 26:05.230
Move.

26:14.040 --> 26:16.170
Take these 3 profiteers into custody.

26:16.270 --> 26:17.730
Investigate thoroughly.

26:17.780 --> 26:18.960
Find out who else bought these from them.

26:18.960 --> 26:19.400
Yes.

26:22.020 --> 26:23.350
Take them into custody!

26:45.710 --> 26:47.170
Please spare us, officer!

26:48.810 --> 26:49.470
Have mercy!

26:52.700 --> 26:53.370
Get in!

27:10.440 --> 27:11.040
Pingyuan.

27:11.680 --> 27:12.280
Boss.

27:13.770 --> 27:14.960
What a coincidence!

27:17.190 --> 27:18.590
How did you end up in here?

27:18.660 --> 27:19.810
W-We...

27:20.640 --> 27:23.520
We were selling braided queues
like how you taught me.

27:23.520 --> 27:25.050
How many times did you sell?

27:26.660 --> 27:27.460
Twice.

27:27.900 --> 27:29.110
What did I tell you?

27:32.060 --> 27:33.130
Boss! Boss!

27:33.620 --> 27:34.790
Stop, Boss, please.

27:34.810 --> 27:36.450
Boss, please stop beating the manager.

27:36.450 --> 27:37.750
The three of us have already

27:37.750 --> 27:39.210
been beaten badly enough.

27:44.890 --> 27:45.910
Good job, you two.

27:46.860 --> 27:48.720
What were my instructions to you?

27:49.600 --> 27:51.060
Now look what's happened.

27:51.160 --> 27:52.690
You've all ended up in here.

27:53.440 --> 27:55.030
We're having a family reunion in Hefei,

27:55.030 --> 27:56.340
waiting to die together.

27:56.340 --> 27:57.200
How wonderful.

27:57.680 --> 27:58.070
Pingyuan,

27:58.070 --> 27:59.280
stop joking around.

27:59.440 --> 27:59.920
They're going

27:59.920 --> 28:00.920
to chop our heads off

28:00.920 --> 28:01.880
and hang them on the city gate!

28:01.880 --> 28:03.690
Please think of a way to save us!

28:03.790 --> 28:04.760
Joking?

28:05.790 --> 28:06.750
Joking?

28:06.790 --> 28:08.040
Boss! Boss! Boss!

28:08.070 --> 28:09.080
Boss! Boss!

28:09.160 --> 28:10.890
Aren't you usually so capable?

28:11.270 --> 28:12.600
Now you want me to save you?

28:12.600 --> 28:13.680
Look at the state I'm in!

28:13.680 --> 28:14.880
How can I save anyone?

28:15.870 --> 28:17.030
Pingyuan, you always have a way!

28:17.030 --> 28:17.880
You always figure something out!

28:17.880 --> 28:19.080
Interrogation time!

28:31.830 --> 28:32.300
Move!

28:32.330 --> 28:32.930
Pingyuan!

28:47.160 --> 28:48.490
We're dead! We're dead!

28:49.200 --> 28:51.110
This time we're really done for!

28:56.790 --> 29:16.590
♪ Brilliant blooms spread everywhere ♪

29:16.930 --> 29:17.590
Yimei.

29:18.640 --> 29:19.310
Gu.

29:20.990 --> 29:26.570
[Happy]

29:33.790 --> 29:34.850
Princess Consort.

29:36.680 --> 29:37.500
My father...

29:37.870 --> 29:40.100
[Happy]

29:38.480 --> 29:41.000
You've come a long way.
It must have been tiring.

29:41.000 --> 29:43.850
This wine is made
from wild fruits from Guangxi.

29:44.160 --> 29:45.090
It's a bit spicy.

29:45.510 --> 29:47.510
Takes some getting used to at first.

29:49.400 --> 29:51.060
You dared to come at this time.

29:51.070 --> 29:52.890
You're indeed bold.

29:53.270 --> 29:54.070
A toast to you.

30:04.400 --> 30:05.280
Excellent.

30:07.030 --> 30:08.560
Wine helps forget sorrows.

30:09.480 --> 30:10.610
Have another glass.

30:12.200 --> 30:13.850
You had Gu tied up all day.

30:14.030 --> 30:15.240
He hasn't eaten all day.

30:15.240 --> 30:16.350
Don't let him drink too much.

30:16.350 --> 30:17.610
You don't understand.

30:18.070 --> 30:19.100
In battle,

30:19.200 --> 30:20.730
I can go 3 days without food.

30:21.110 --> 30:22.770
But not letting me have a drink

30:22.880 --> 30:24.340
would be a true injustice.

30:27.000 --> 30:27.930
Come on. Come on.

30:28.400 --> 30:29.400
Let's sit down, the three of us,

30:29.400 --> 30:30.530
and have a good talk.

30:31.400 --> 30:32.130
Please, sit.

30:38.350 --> 30:40.240
During my patrol of the city today,

30:40.240 --> 30:42.100
someone startled your carriage.

30:42.440 --> 30:44.000
I knew it must be you, Gu.

30:44.680 --> 30:47.210
I put you in jail just to avoid suspicion.

30:48.070 --> 30:49.730
Sorry for the inconvenience.

30:50.920 --> 30:53.070
This drink is my apology.

31:00.270 --> 31:01.280
These days,

31:02.110 --> 31:03.400
the Princess Consort has often

31:03.400 --> 31:04.530
mentioned you to me.

31:05.200 --> 31:07.200
The kindness you've shown to Yimei—

31:07.680 --> 31:08.910
we

31:09.070 --> 31:11.240
can never repay in this lifetime.

31:16.070 --> 31:16.870
I understand.

31:17.350 --> 31:17.880
Good.

31:19.110 --> 31:20.640
Let's get down to business.

31:20.880 --> 31:22.140
What brings you here,

31:22.200 --> 31:23.220
Gu?

31:27.160 --> 31:27.890
I was

31:28.590 --> 31:30.000
sent by Mr. Bai.

31:32.200 --> 31:34.480
His life is hanging by a thread now.

31:40.420 --> 31:42.220
He wants to see her one last time.

31:46.110 --> 31:47.380
I hope you can go back.

31:48.030 --> 31:48.750
Go back?

31:51.540 --> 31:53.600
Who among you would accept her there?

31:54.030 --> 31:54.700
If Yimei can be safe

31:54.700 --> 31:55.810
after she returns,

31:55.840 --> 31:57.440
I'll take her back right now.

31:59.440 --> 32:00.030
Gu,

32:00.510 --> 32:01.480
you need to come up with

32:01.480 --> 32:03.010
a more practical solution.

32:03.240 --> 32:05.170
You have to go back, no matter what.

32:06.030 --> 32:07.490
This might be the last time

32:08.200 --> 32:09.330
you see your father.

32:15.070 --> 32:17.200
If necessary, we'll sneak in at night.

32:18.590 --> 32:19.160
Fine.

32:21.550 --> 32:22.880
I'll go back with Yimei.

32:23.310 --> 32:24.950
I'll pay my respects to the old man,

32:24.950 --> 32:26.480
so he can pass away in peace.

32:26.960 --> 32:28.680
That's absolutely impossible.

32:28.680 --> 32:30.080
You can't take this risk.

32:30.350 --> 32:31.070
You are a prince.

32:31.070 --> 32:32.400
To hell with that title.

32:32.900 --> 32:34.460
I am your husband now.

32:34.960 --> 32:35.640
Besides,

32:37.070 --> 32:38.350
I trust Gu.

32:40.590 --> 32:42.160
Even if something goes wrong,

32:42.160 --> 32:43.070
we, as husband and wife,

32:43.070 --> 32:44.400
will die together.

32:48.400 --> 32:48.980
Gu,

32:49.440 --> 32:50.570
I'll go get changed,

32:50.720 --> 32:52.380
and we'll leave immediately.

33:00.270 --> 33:02.000
Pingwen and 2 other assistants

33:02.440 --> 33:04.100
are still locked up in prison.

33:05.510 --> 33:06.710
Did they beat him?

33:06.880 --> 33:08.410
How come I didn't know that?

33:10.140 --> 33:10.790
Please find someone quickly

33:10.790 --> 33:11.780
to release them.

33:12.480 --> 33:13.940
I'll wait for you outside.

33:23.430 --> 33:25.380
[Desheng Gate]

33:38.000 --> 33:38.590
Mr. Bai.

33:41.700 --> 33:43.160
I thought you were asleep.

33:47.840 --> 33:51.170
I haven't been able to sleep or eat
these past few days.

33:53.220 --> 33:55.540
I sit by the door, exhausted,

33:56.220 --> 33:58.430
but as soon as I lie down, I'm wide awake.

34:00.590 --> 34:01.630
Yesterday,

34:01.790 --> 34:04.070
I suddenly dreamed of Yimei's mother.

34:06.160 --> 34:08.020
I believe the time for our reunion

34:08.030 --> 34:09.389
is not far away.

34:10.280 --> 34:11.500
I just don't know

34:12.440 --> 34:14.960
how to tell her about our daughter.

34:17.320 --> 34:18.000
Mr. Bai,

34:19.280 --> 34:20.679
please don't hate Yimei.

34:21.000 --> 34:22.550
She can be childish sometimes,

34:22.550 --> 34:22.960
but—

34:22.960 --> 34:24.420
She's not a child anymore.

34:25.190 --> 34:26.050
She's grown up.

34:28.150 --> 34:29.110
I don't hate her.

34:41.590 --> 34:42.630
Come in.

35:14.560 --> 35:15.020
Mr. Bai.

35:18.020 --> 35:19.420
This is General Li Cheng,

35:19.880 --> 35:21.340
Yimei's current husband.

35:22.280 --> 35:23.140
Don't be upset.

35:24.280 --> 35:25.140
Don't be upset.

35:48.280 --> 35:49.170
I'm not upset.

35:51.400 --> 35:53.130
Though we've never met before,

35:54.280 --> 35:56.320
I should still show some courtesy.

36:00.220 --> 36:01.410
Please rise.

36:04.610 --> 36:05.860
Father,

36:06.550 --> 36:08.680
please forgive my unfilial behavior.

36:10.030 --> 36:11.130
I truly and sincerely

36:11.130 --> 36:12.740
want to be with him.

36:14.770 --> 36:16.300
Please forgive me, Father.

36:22.230 --> 36:23.510
When you two got together,

36:23.510 --> 36:25.050
you never informed me.

36:25.190 --> 36:27.150
Why would you need my forgiveness?

36:28.690 --> 36:29.610
Father.

36:30.630 --> 36:32.330
I will take good care of Yimei.

36:32.710 --> 36:34.620
I will honor my vow for all my days.

36:34.960 --> 36:36.290
Should I defy this oath,

36:36.510 --> 36:38.970
let me be pierced through
by a hail of arrows.

36:39.670 --> 36:41.270
Father, please rest assured

36:41.800 --> 36:43.260
and take care of yourself.

36:53.630 --> 36:55.180
Please rise, General Li.

36:56.510 --> 36:58.510
I don't serve in the imperial court.

36:58.630 --> 37:00.340
We are not enemies.

37:02.880 --> 37:04.480
Both of you, please stand up.

37:05.800 --> 37:06.860
Thank you, Father.

37:08.920 --> 37:09.550
Mr. Bai.

37:10.110 --> 37:10.800
Rise.

37:11.800 --> 37:13.400
I'll keep watch in the courtyard

37:13.400 --> 37:15.060
to prevent any disturbances.

37:16.800 --> 37:17.510
Thank you.

38:10.320 --> 38:11.450
How is Mr. Bai doing?

38:12.020 --> 38:13.880
I just made him a fresh decoction.

38:14.190 --> 38:14.800
He drank it

38:15.110 --> 38:16.110
and went to sleep.

38:27.400 --> 38:28.250
What do you mean by this?

38:28.250 --> 38:28.730
Gu.

38:30.960 --> 38:32.890
It's easy to kill, but hard to save.

38:33.360 --> 38:34.090
It's easier for us

38:34.090 --> 38:35.550
to rush here day and night.

38:35.760 --> 38:38.160
But taking care of the elderly
day after day

38:38.280 --> 38:39.280
is harder for you.

38:42.690 --> 38:44.950
Please receive our kowtow in gratitude.

39:11.710 --> 39:12.250
Let's go.

39:40.940 --> 39:42.480
How can you not tell left from right?

39:42.480 --> 39:43.340
Manager.

39:43.560 --> 39:44.740
You're the one
who can't tell left from right.

39:44.740 --> 39:45.510
I am the manager.

39:45.510 --> 39:47.360
How could I not know left from right?

39:47.360 --> 39:47.910
Boss!

39:48.150 --> 39:48.840
Pingyuan!

39:48.920 --> 39:49.810
Pingyuan! Pingyuan! Pingyuan!

39:49.810 --> 39:51.320
Pingyuan! Pingyuan! Pingyuan!

39:51.320 --> 39:51.920
Think of a way

39:51.920 --> 39:53.200
to get us up there.

39:54.670 --> 39:56.150
Why should I get you up there?

39:56.150 --> 39:56.780
To go home?

39:57.040 --> 39:58.000
I'm injured like this.

39:58.000 --> 39:59.200
Where else would I go?

40:00.800 --> 40:01.670
Look at the state you're in.

40:01.670 --> 40:03.070
What would you do at home?

40:03.070 --> 40:04.070
Besides scaring our mother,

40:04.070 --> 40:05.070
what else can you do?

40:05.070 --> 40:05.860
Do we have wound medicine at home?

40:05.860 --> 40:07.260
Or a doctor for injuries?

40:08.880 --> 40:10.150
Go back and stay at the shop.

40:10.150 --> 40:11.610
Let me tell you something.

40:11.920 --> 40:13.450
Just move slowly like this.

40:14.230 --> 40:15.050
It's so damp.

40:15.280 --> 40:16.610
Don't lie on the ground.

40:16.800 --> 40:19.060
Once you lie down, you won't get up again.

40:19.230 --> 40:20.290
Words of wisdom.

40:20.550 --> 40:21.760
Don't take them lightly.

40:21.760 --> 40:24.390
But it's dozens of li down there.

40:24.760 --> 40:25.960
Then what do you want?

40:26.630 --> 40:28.760
Should I carry you up there? Is that it?

40:29.010 --> 40:30.350
Manager, Manager.

40:30.480 --> 40:31.510
Let's listen to Boss.

40:31.510 --> 40:32.510
Let's walk back.

40:32.630 --> 40:33.400
You...

40:33.840 --> 40:34.410
Go.

40:35.760 --> 40:36.820
Follow my command.

40:38.000 --> 40:38.880
One, two, three.

40:38.880 --> 40:39.410
Left leg.

40:41.190 --> 40:42.720
One, two, three. Right leg.

40:44.190 --> 40:45.550
One, two, three. Left leg!

40:45.550 --> 40:47.310
You two jerks.

40:47.710 --> 40:49.240
One, two, three. Right leg!

40:50.440 --> 40:51.410
Left leg!

40:51.590 --> 40:52.380
Go!

40:52.400 --> 40:54.140
Why are you shouting so loudly?

40:54.170 --> 40:55.190
Right leg! Go!

40:57.800 --> 40:59.020
Why are you so clumsy?

40:59.050 --> 40:59.790
Get up now!

41:01.880 --> 41:03.630
I'll call out the slogan. I'll do it.

41:03.630 --> 41:04.560
Come on. Come on.

41:04.580 --> 41:05.620
One, two, three.

41:05.760 --> 41:06.670
Left leg.

41:07.030 --> 41:07.960
One, two, three.

41:08.120 --> 41:09.150
Right leg.

41:49.590 --> 41:50.730
Is Mr. Liao here?

41:51.920 --> 41:54.120
I'm Gu Pingyuan from Shanjian Village.

41:54.190 --> 41:55.230
Is Mr. Liao here?

42:01.920 --> 42:03.230
There's no Mr. Liao here.

42:03.230 --> 42:04.430
Don't be so annoying.

42:05.270 --> 42:05.920
Miss!

42:06.840 --> 42:07.960
Bai Shi'an in Shanjian Village,

42:07.960 --> 42:08.550
Mr. Bai,

42:08.670 --> 42:09.730
sent me to find him.

42:09.750 --> 42:12.080
[Miss Liao]

42:17.110 --> 42:19.400
Are you really not here to collect debts?

42:24.630 --> 42:25.150
Come in.

42:26.190 --> 42:26.760
Hurry up.

42:49.230 --> 42:50.700
Father, come out.

42:51.160 --> 42:52.620
It's not a debt collector.

42:57.920 --> 43:00.850
If you're not here to collect debts,

43:01.400 --> 43:02.910
then you must be here to deliver money.
